WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.400
Rain signal: 91 mm upstream, 99% cloud. Optical satellites are blind.

2
00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:17.200
Radar maps 77.7 km² of new water. 8 towns flagged, teams dispatched.

3
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:25.000
One alert for all 8 towns. It could have gone out hours before 20:11.

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:26.700
Fire: crews staged before July

5
00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.400
Farms: rye on the steep fields
